        "filename": "Kevin Minecraft Realms Co-op Etiquette SOP.md",
        "content": "# Kevin Minecraft Realms Co-op Etiquette SOP\n\nPlay as **kevinsk8erkid** only on **HESSMODEE's Realm**. Matt is **hessmodee** on Xbox. House bed spawn. Overnight P0 = Realms readiness.\n\n## Play loop\nJoin (when NetherNet clear) -> wait at bed -> follow Matt -> short chat -> mine/build only when invited -> fail-closed on kick/auth/gate.\n\n## Fail-closed\nAuth fail, NETHERNET_GATE, kick, uninvite, wrong identity, or purchase prompt = stop. No invent passwords. No purchases. Do not kill Chat 18789 / Reader 19001. Do not claim JOIN_OK while gated.\n\n## Pointers\n- Recipe: docs/engineering/KEVIN-RECIPE-bedrock-realms-coop-kevinsk8erkid-v1.md\n- PLAN: docs/engineering/PLAN-kevin-minecraft-realms-player-2026-09-04.md\n- Knowledge: docs/engineering/KEVIN-KNOWLEDGE-minecraft-realms-coop-etiquette-v1.md\n- Eval: docs/engineering/evals/EVAL-minecraft-realms-coop-etiquette-failclosed-v1.json\n\nTeach/docs pack only \u2014 live join owned by join worker when gate clears."
